# All three regenerated by data-raw/dump_ct_codelists.py from the pinned engine
# cache, and 46, 69 and 30 MB of it. The other dump_*.csv files are kept because
# they are a megabyte at most and save cloning a 400 MB repository to rebuild
# an .rds; these three are past that trade.
data-raw/ct_codelists.csv
data-raw/ct_pref_terms.csv
data-raw/ct_synonyms.csv
# The pinned JSONata download. data-raw/vendor_jsonata.py says where it comes
# from and refuses anything whose checksum is not the pinned one, and the copy
# that ships is tracked under inst/extdata/js, so keeping a second copy here
# would only be a second thing to keep in step.
data-raw/vendor/
tests/conformance/scoreboard.csv
tests/conformance/scoreboard_v1_*.csv
tests/conformance/.v1_rules.rds
